# An allowlist: the build context is the whole repo, which also holds the
# frontend, docs, tests, local scan output and a .env, so everything is
# excluded and only what the API image needs is let back in.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!promptshield/
!backend/main.py
!backend/scan.py
!backend/limits.py
!backend/lockcheck.py
!backend/requirements.txt
!backend/build-requirements.txt

# Never in the image, even inside an allowed folder. The evaluation data is
# the labelled benchmark, the spent holdouts and the score baseline: the API
# never reads them, and they stay out of anything that ships.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
promptshield/evaluation/data/
